	<string key="Quest_42000_description" rel_version="Territory_Dunwood" speaker="UI - Quest Description">Eliza Ellingwood, a strange and cryptic historian, has asked me to help look for soul trapped within special statues thoughout Nighthaven. She says that doing so will help &apos;restore the lost one,&apos; but even she doesn&apos;t seem to know exactly what she means.</string>
	<string key="Quest_42000_title" rel_version="Territory_Dunwood" speaker="UI - Quest Title">Silent Sentries</string>
