	<string key="Quest_42002_description" rel_version="Territory_Dunwood" speaker="UI - Quest Description">Eliza says the voice is becoming more clear as I collect more of the fragments, and has asked that I continue to do so. She says I should contuinue to look in the hidden places around Nighthaven for more of the statues.</string>
